Architecture of This Lab
Block Storage Example

MySQL Pod
    ↓
PVC (db-pod-pvc)
    ↓
StorageClass (lvms-vg1)
    ↓
Local Block Storage
Shared Storage Example

App Pod ───┐
           │
           ▼
        PVC (nfs-pvc)
           │
           ▼
        NFS Storage
           ▲
           │
Web Pod ───┘
